        <mxCell id="n_note" value="Forecast method: average revenue &amp; cost for the same weekday over the trailing N occurrences (e.g. the last 8 Fridays) from stored Transactions for the active site, projected forward — the same &quot;trailing average → project forward&quot; approach already used for the 30-day cash-out forecast in aggregate.ts. Purely historical — no live call involved. If &quot;All Sites&quot; is selected, the same query aggregates across every site&#39;s Transactions instead of filtering to one siteId." style="text;html=1;fontSize=10;fontStyle=2;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontColor=#666666;whiteSpace=wrap;" parent="1" vertex="1">
